IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg7-governing-provisions`
IMPORT `dg7-appraisal-rights`
IMPORT `dg7-appraisal-procedure`

-- Tests of dg7-appraisal-procedure.l4 (8 Del. C. s 262(d), (e), (f)).
-- Every expected value is decided here from the text of s 262(d) to (f) (src:1263-1268), counting calendar days with the last
-- day of a "within N days" period inside the period (fork F-d1), then compared with the rule's answer.

§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN says IS A BOOLEAN
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
      copy262 IS A BOOLEAN
      copy114 IS A BOOLEAN
      resource262 IS A BOOLEAN
      resource114 IS A BOOLEAN
      effective IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(d) Notice of appraisal rights`
`test a notice with` says approved copy262 copy114 resource262 resource114 effective MEANS
    `s 262(d) Notice of appraisal rights` WITH
        `states that appraisal rights are available for any or all of the shares` IS says
        `states that the transaction has been approved` IS approved
        `includes a copy of s 262` IS copy262
        `includes a copy of s 114` IS copy114
        `directs the stockholders to a publicly available electronic resource where s 262 may be accessed without subscription or cost` IS resource262
        `directs the stockholders to a publicly available electronic resource where s 114 may be accessed without subscription or cost` IS resource114
        `states the effective date of the transaction` IS effective

GIVEN beforeVote IS A BOOLEAN
      how IS A `s 262(d) How the demand was delivered`
      identity IS A BOOLEAN
      intent IS A BOOLEAN
      separate IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(d)(1) Demand before the vote`
`test a demand before the vote with` beforeVote how identity intent separate MEANS
    `s 262(d)(1) Demand before the vote` WITH
        `delivered to the corporation before the taking of the vote` IS beforeVote
        `how the demand was delivered` IS how
        `the demand reasonably informs the corporation of the identity of the stockholder` IS identity
        `the demand reasonably informs the corporation that the stockholder intends thereby to demand the appraisal of the stockholder's shares` IS intent
        `the demand is a separate written demand and not merely a proxy or a vote against the transaction` IS separate

GIVEN delivered IS A DATE
      how IS A `s 262(d) How the demand was delivered`
      identity IS A BOOLEAN
      intent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(d)(2) Demand after the notice`
`test a demand after the notice with` delivered how identity intent MEANS
    `s 262(d)(2) Demand after the notice` WITH
        `the date the demand was delivered` IS delivered
        `how the demand was delivered` IS how
        `the demand reasonably informs the entity of the identity of the stockholder` IS identity
        `the demand reasonably informs the entity that the stockholder intends thereby to demand the appraisal of the holder's shares` IS intent

GIVEN asWritten IS A BOOLEAN
      identifies IS A BOOLEAN
      evidence IS A BOOLEAN
      statement IS A BOOLEAN
      address IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(d)(3) The beneficial owner's demand`
`test a beneficial owner's demand with` asWritten identifies evidence statement address MEANS
    `s 262(d)(3) The beneficial owner's demand` WITH
        `the demand is made in writing in the beneficial owner's name in accordance with paragraph (d)(1) or (2), as applicable` IS asWritten
        `the demand reasonably identifies the holder of record of the shares for which the demand is made` IS identifies
        `the demand is accompanied by documentary evidence of the beneficial owner's beneficial ownership of stock` IS evidence
        `the demand is accompanied by a statement that the documentary evidence is a true and correct copy of what it purports to be` IS statement
        `the demand provides an address at which the beneficial owner consents to receive notices and to be set forth on the verified list` IS address

`test a good notice` MEANS `test a notice with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

§ `s 262(d) -- the shared building blocks`

#ASSERT `s 262(d) the demand was delivered in a way the subsection allows` `in writing, not by electronic transmission`
#ASSERT `s 262(d) the demand was delivered in a way the subsection allows` `by electronic transmission directed to an information processing system expressly designated for that purpose in the notice`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the demand was delivered in a way the subsection allows` `by electronic transmission not so directed`)

#ASSERT `s 262(d) the demand is sufficient in what it says` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the demand is sufficient in what it says` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the demand is sufficient in what it says` FALSE TRUE)

-- "if 1 of the constituent corporations or the converting corporation is a nonstock corporation".
#ASSERT `s 262(d) one of the corporations is a nonstock corporation` (LIST `a stock corporation`, `a charitable nonstock corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 262(d) one of the corporations is a nonstock corporation` (LIST `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) one of the corporations is a nonstock corporation` (LIST `a stock corporation`, `a stock corporation`))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) one of the corporations is a nonstock corporation` EMPTY)

-- A copy of s 262 is enough where all the corporations are stock corporations.
#ASSERT `s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE
-- Where a constituent is nonstock, a copy of s 114 is needed too.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE
-- Or the electronic resource, with s 114 where applicable.
#ASSERT `s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) TRUE
-- Neither a copy nor a resource.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE)
-- A copy of s 114 alone does not offer s 262.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d) the notice offers s 262 and, if one of the corporations is nonstock, s 114` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)

§ `s 262(d)(1) -- notice before a meeting`

#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) paragraph (1) governs the transaction` `approved at a meeting of stockholders`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) paragraph (1) governs the transaction` `approved pursuant to s 251(h)`)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) paragraph (2) governs the transaction` `approved by consent of stockholders pursuant to s 228`
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) paragraph (2) governs the transaction` `approved pursuant to s 251(h)`
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) paragraph (2) governs the transaction` `approved pursuant to s 253`
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) paragraph (2) governs the transaction` `approved pursuant to s 267`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) paragraph (2) governs the transaction` `approved at a meeting of stockholders`)

-- Meeting on 31 March 2026: "not less than 20 days prior" is 11 March 2026 at the latest.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the latest date for the corporation's notice of the meeting` (YMD 2026 3 31) EQUALS YMD 2026 3 11
-- Meeting on 5 March 2026: 20 days before is 13 February 2026 (February 2026 has 28 days).
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the latest date for the corporation's notice of the meeting` (YMD 2026 3 5) EQUALS YMD 2026 2 13
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the corporation's notice was given in time` (YMD 2026 3 11) (YMD 2026 3 31)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the corporation's notice was given in time` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 31)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the corporation's notice was given in time` (YMD 2026 3 12) (YMD 2026 3 31))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the corporation's notice was given in time` (YMD 2026 3 31) (YMD 2026 3 31))

-- Who is owed the notice: a record-date stockholder, or a member who got notice under s 255(c), with shares that carry appraisal rights.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the corporation must notify the person of the availability of appraisal rights` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the corporation must notify the person of the availability of appraisal rights` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the corporation must notify the person of the availability of appraisal rights` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the corporation must notify the person of the availability of appraisal rights` FALSE FALSE TRUE)

-- The contents.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` `test a good notice` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` `test a good notice` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE)

-- The demand: everything right.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` TRUE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` TRUE `by electronic transmission directed to an information processing system expressly designated for that purpose in the notice` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- After the vote.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` FALSE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE TRUE))
-- By e-mail to nobody in particular.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` TRUE `by electronic transmission not so directed` TRUE TRUE TRUE))
-- Does not identify the stockholder / does not say it demands appraisal.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` TRUE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` TRUE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE FALSE TRUE))
-- A proxy or a vote against is not a demand.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand before the vote with` TRUE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE FALSE))

-- The notice of the effective date: 10 days after the effective date. Effective 25 June 2026: 5 July 2026 at the latest.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the latest date for the notice of the effective date` (YMD 2026 6 25) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 5
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the notice of the effective date was given in time` (YMD 2026 7 5) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the notice of the effective date was given in time` (YMD 2026 7 6) (YMD 2026 6 25))
-- Owed to a stockholder who complied and did not vote for it or consent; and to a beneficial owner who demanded.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the entity must notify the person of the date the transaction became effective` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the entity must notify the person of the date the transaction became effective` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(1) the entity must notify the person of the date the transaction became effective` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(1) the entity must notify the person of the date the transaction became effective` FALSE FALSE TRUE

§ `s 262(d)(2) -- notice after approval without a meeting`

-- A constituent corporation must give the first notice before the effective date; the surviving entity within 10 days after it.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the first notice was given in time` `a constituent, converting, transferring, domesticating or continuing corporation` (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the first notice was given in time` `a constituent, converting, transferring, domesticating or continuing corporation` (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the first notice was given in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 7 5) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the first notice was given in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the first notice was given in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 7 6) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the first notice was given in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))

-- "if given on or after the effective date ..., shall, also notify such stockholders of the effective date".
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the notice must also state the effective date` (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the notice must also state the effective date` (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the notice must also state the effective date` (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))

-- The contents: approval stated, appraisal rights available, s 262 offered, effective date if given on or after it.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))
-- Given on the effective date, the notice shall also state it.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) FALSE (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25)
-- A nonstock constituent: a copy of s 114 is also needed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the notice has the contents the paragraph requires` (`test a notice with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))

-- The later of two dates.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the later of the two dates` (YMD 2026 7 10) (YMD 2026 7 15) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 15
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the later of the two dates` (YMD 2026 7 15) (YMD 2026 7 10) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 15
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the later of the two dates` (YMD 2026 7 10) (YMD 2026 7 10) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 10

-- Notice given 20 June 2026: demand by 10 July 2026 (June has 30 days: 20 + 20 = 40 - 30 = 10 July).
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the last day for the stockholder's demand` `approved by consent of stockholders pursuant to s 228` (YMD 2026 6 20) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)
-- A s 251(h) merger: the later of the offer's consummation and 20 days after the notice.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the last day for the stockholder's demand` `approved pursuant to s 251(h)` (YMD 2026 6 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 15)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 7 15)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the last day for the stockholder's demand` `approved pursuant to s 251(h)` (YMD 2026 6 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 1)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)
-- Not covered: a s 251(h) merger with no consummation date given.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the last day for the stockholder's demand` `approved pursuant to s 251(h)` (YMD 2026 6 20) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 253 and s 267 mergers use the 20-day period.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the last day for the stockholder's demand` `approved pursuant to s 253` (YMD 2026 6 20) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)

-- The demand: on the last day is in time; a day later is not.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand after the notice with` (YMD 2026 7 10) `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand after the notice with` (YMD 2026 7 11) `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand after the notice with` (YMD 2026 7 1) `by electronic transmission not so directed` TRUE TRUE) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand after the notice with` (YMD 2026 7 1) `in writing, not by electronic transmission` FALSE TRUE) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: no last day known (a s 251(h) merger whose consummation date is not given).
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the stockholder's demand is good` (`test a demand after the notice with` (YMD 2026 7 1) `in writing, not by electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- The second notice.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) a second notice is required` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) a second notice is required` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice was sent in time` `a constituent, converting, transferring, domesticating or continuing corporation` (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the second notice was sent in time` `a constituent, converting, transferring, domesticating or continuing corporation` (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice was sent in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice was sent in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 7 5) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the second notice was sent in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 7 6) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the second notice was sent in time` `the surviving, resulting or converted entity` (YMD 2026 6 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))

-- First notice sent 20 June 2026: a second notice sent by 10 July 2026 goes to all holders entitled; later, only to those who demanded.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the last day on which the second notice must go to every holder entitled to appraisal rights` `approved by consent of stockholders pursuant to s 228` (YMD 2026 6 20) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice must be sent to the holder` (YMD 2026 7 10) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice must be sent to the holder` (YMD 2026 7 11) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice must be sent to the holder` (YMD 2026 7 11) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice must be sent to the holder` (YMD 2026 7 11) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice must be sent to the holder` (YMD 2026 7 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 7 10)) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: a s 251(h) merger whose consummation date is not given.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the second notice must be sent to the holder` (YMD 2026 7 11) NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The affidavit.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `the secretary of the corporation or entity` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `the assistant secretary of the corporation or entity` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `the transfer agent of the corporation or entity` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `someone else` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `the secretary of the corporation or entity` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `the secretary of the corporation or entity` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(2) the affidavit is prima facie evidence that the notice was given` `the secretary of the corporation or entity` TRUE FALSE FALSE)

-- The record date. Notice on or after the effective date (25 June 2026): the effective date.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 6 25) (YMD 2026 6 25) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2026 6 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 6 28)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 6 25)
-- Notice before the effective date, no record date fixed: the day next preceding the day the notice is given.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 6 20) (YMD 2026 6 25) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 6 19)
-- The day next preceding 1 March 2026 is 28 February 2026.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 20) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 2 28)
-- A record date fixed in advance, not more than 10 days prior to the notice (20 June 2026): 10 June is allowed; 9 June is not.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 6 20) (YMD 2026 6 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 6 10)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 6 10)
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 6 20) (YMD 2026 6 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 6 15)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 6 15)
-- Not covered: more than 10 days before the notice, or after it.
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 6 20) (YMD 2026 6 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 6 9)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 262(d)(2) the record date for the notice` (YMD 2026 6 20) (YMD 2026 6 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 6 21)) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 262(d)(3) -- a beneficial owner's own demand`

`test a claimant for a beneficial owner` MEANS
    `s 262(a) Claimant` WITH
        `the stock is stock of a corporation formed` IS `this State`
        `the claimant holds the stock as holder of record` IS FALSE
        `held shares of stock on the date of the making of the demand` IS TRUE
        `continuously held the shares through the effective date` IS TRUE
        `has otherwise complied with subsection (d)` IS TRUE
        `voted in favor of the merger, consolidation, conversion, transfer, domestication or continuance` IS FALSE
        `consented to it in writing pursuant to s 228` IS FALSE

`test a claimant for a beneficial owner who held for a day` MEANS
    `s 262(a) Claimant` WITH
        `the stock is stock of a corporation formed` IS `this State`
        `the claimant holds the stock as holder of record` IS FALSE
        `held shares of stock on the date of the making of the demand` IS TRUE
        `continuously held the shares through the effective date` IS FALSE
        `has otherwise complied with subsection (d)` IS TRUE
        `voted in favor of the merger, consolidation, conversion, transfer, domestication or continuance` IS FALSE
        `consented to it in writing pursuant to s 228` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- Not a beneficial owner.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` FALSE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
-- Did not hold continuously through the effective date.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner who held for a day` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
-- Each element of limb (ii) is needed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(d)(3) the beneficial owner's demand is good` TRUE `test a claimant for a beneficial owner` (`test a beneficial owner's demand with` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))

§ `s 262(e) -- the petition, withdrawal and statement`

-- Effective 25 June 2026: 120 days later is 23 October 2026 (5 days left in June, 31 July, 31 August, 30 September, 23 October).
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the last day for a petition` (YMD 2026 6 25) EQUALS YMD 2026 10 23
-- The surviving entity may petition by that day; a stockholder who complied and is entitled may too.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the person may commence an appraisal proceeding by this petition` TRUE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 10 23) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the person may commence an appraisal proceeding by this petition` FALSE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 10 23) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may commence an appraisal proceeding by this petition` FALSE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 10 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may commence an appraisal proceeding by this petition` TRUE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 10 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may commence an appraisal proceeding by this petition` FALSE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may commence an appraisal proceeding by this petition` FALSE TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25))

-- Withdrawal within 60 days: 25 June 2026 + 60 days is 24 August 2026.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the person may withdraw the demand and accept the terms offered` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 8 24) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may withdraw the demand and accept the terms offered` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 8 25) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may withdraw the demand and accept the terms offered` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person may withdraw the demand and accept the terms offered` FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25))

-- The statement: a person who complied, asking in time by an allowed way.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the person is entitled to receive the statement` TRUE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` (YMD 2026 10 23) (YMD 2026 6 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person is entitled to receive the statement` TRUE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` (YMD 2026 10 24) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person is entitled to receive the statement` FALSE `in writing, not by electronic transmission` (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the person is entitled to receive the statement` TRUE `by electronic transmission not so directed` (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25))
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the person is entitled to receive the statement` TRUE `by electronic transmission directed to an information processing system expressly designated for that purpose in the notice` (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 6 25)

-- The statement is due 10 days after the request is received or 10 days after the demand period expired, whichever is later.
-- Request 1 July, period expired 5 July: 11 July and 15 July, so 15 July.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the last day for the statement` (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2026 7 5) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 15
-- Request 1 August, period expired 5 July: 11 August and 15 July, so 11 August.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the last day for the statement` (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 7 5) EQUALS YMD 2026 8 11
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the statement was given in time` (YMD 2026 7 15) (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2026 7 5)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(e) the statement was given in time` (YMD 2026 7 16) (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2026 7 5))
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the statement was given in time` (YMD 2026 8 11) (YMD 2026 8 1) (YMD 2026 7 5)

-- The numbers: a s 251(h) merger (1,000 shares in the offer, 100 of them excluded stock, 700 tendered and accepted): 200 shares.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the number of shares the statement sets out for a s 251(h) merger` 1000 100 700 EQUALS 200
-- 10 record holders demanded; 2 of those hold shares that a beneficial owner demanded for; 3 beneficial owners demanded: 10 - 2 + 3 = 11.
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the aggregate number of stockholders or beneficial owners the statement sets out` 10 2 3 EQUALS 11
#ASSERT `s 262(e) the aggregate number of stockholders or beneficial owners the statement sets out` 4 0 0 EQUALS 4

§ `s 262(f) -- the verified list`

-- Served 1 July 2026: the list is due 21 July 2026.
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the last day for the entity to file the verified list` (YMD 2026 7 1) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 21
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the verified list was filed in time` (YMD 2026 7 21) (YMD 2026 7 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the verified list was filed in time` (YMD 2026 7 22) (YMD 2026 7 1))
-- Served 20 January 2026: 20 days later is 9 February 2026.
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the last day for the entity to file the verified list` (YMD 2026 1 20) EQUALS YMD 2026 2 9
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the petition filed by the entity has the list it must have` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the petition filed by the entity has the list it must have` FALSE)
-- Who is on the list: demanded, and no agreement as to value.
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the person's name and address belong on the verified list` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the person's name and address belong on the verified list` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the person's name and address belong on the verified list` FALSE FALSE)
-- Notice of the hearing by mail only if the Court so ordered.
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the person must be sent notice of the hearing by registered or certified mail at the address on the list` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the person must be sent notice of the hearing by registered or certified mail at the address on the list` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the person must be sent notice of the hearing by registered or certified mail at the address on the list` FALSE TRUE)
-- The costs of the notices fall on the surviving, resulting or converted entity.
#ASSERT `s 262(f) the party that bears the costs of the notices` EQUALS `another party named in the provision` "the surviving, resulting or converted entity"
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(f) the party that bears the costs of the notices` EQUALS `a stockholder`)
